u/194539?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mekhovov","html_url":"https://github.com/mekhovov","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mekhovov/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mekhovov/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mekhovov/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mekhovov/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mekhovov/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mekhovov/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mekhovov/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mekhovov/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mekhovov/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/json","state":"uploaded","size":1915,"digest":"sha256:02f995032e36a6c43bade90a7735ae13b1eb7e4c2c5c1a2a90d93755e8470e96","download_count":1,"created_at":"2026-09-22T23:49:33Z","updated_at":"2026-09-22T23:49:33Z","browser_download_url":"https://github.com/mekhovov/revealline/releases/download/v0.87.0/verification.json"}],"tarball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mekhovov/revealline/tarball/v0.87.0","zipball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mekhovov/revealline/zipball/v0.87.0","body":"## RevealLine v0.87.0 — Xposed-paced movement defaults\n\nStandard difficulty now uses movement ratios calibrated from verified Xposed Reloaded Normal-rate footage: the craft travels about 0.26 short fields per second, ordinary moving threats about 0.325, and border patrols about 0.24. The sampled measurements carry roughly 3–5% uncertainty and are used as bounded reference values rather than a claim about every Xposed level. This restores the intended pressure relationship where the craft cannot simply outrun ordinary field threats.\n\nAuthored Standard enemy counts remain intact, including the one-enemy lesson. Gentle, Expert and bounded administrator controls remain available. Existing `gp1` saves and replays reconstruct their original rules; new sessions use the calibrated rules without changing earned progression or award identity.\n\nSource: `08548aeabe72f396fb75aede938d5bcadcfdc00e` (tree `6d85b9096d089b740a9eacf5e38eb5ebdfce5874`), merged through [PR #279](https://github.com/mekhovov/revealline/pull/279).\n\nThe exact-head [PR checks](https://github.com/mekhovov/revealline/actions/runs/35794493627) passed preflight and the ordinary production build. The actual merged-source [qualification and freeze](https://github.com/mekhovov/revealline/actions/runs/35797883977) passed source identity, validation, lint, formatting, native formatting, motion syntax, production reproduction/readiness and the immutable freeze. Automated suites were explicitly waived under the temporary reviewed policy; no passing full-suite verdict is claimed.\n\nThe guarded read-only [artifact inspection](https://github.com/mekhovov/revealline/actions/runs/35798689023) verified every Git source blob/type/mode and source TAR commit, every distribution manifest byte and hash chain, and the bounded offline inventory. The shipped manifest contains the exact frozen distribution graph.\n\nOriginal distribution: 591,074,581 bytes, SHA-256 `4131bd0a0ec6a5cea5c12e4a81c4969c141c9a30ef28342ea53b032f18afa5ff`.\n\nOriginal source archive: 1,616,773,120 bytes, SHA-256 `1a319a7da822caac270b1735c04d036ca4e8a6122053304a990f4d3a04b76320`.\n\nPages selection, Archive55 preservation, public byte verification and bounded browser checks remain separate acceptance gates until the selector PR is merged and the deployed site is checked. Physical controllers, physical touch, cold-offline use, full campaign balance and musical/listening acceptance are not claimed by this release package.\n"}